(5483441, 789814, 28742, '<td valign="top">Aaaack! It''s the plant with a thousand nipples! ;-)</td>', 'Aaaack! It''s the plant with a thousand nipples! ;-)', '2009-05-13 04:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5483444, 790696, 28742, '<td valign="top">5</td>', '5', '2009-05-13 04:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5483446, 790696, 32011, '<td valign="top">I think you might be wrong in this instance... reckon this will do better than 5.0000... but I have to say, I feel your pain.  But, lets talk about the photo.  A tad on the uninteresting side for my liking... there''s not enough here to keep me looking.  Don''t get me wrong, it''s a pretty scene, there''s just no real subject that grabs the viewer.  Colours are good, though I think I see a hint of pink in some of the clouds... I do like your tag line though, well and truly fitting for the challenge.  I hope that you get above 5.0000, I honestly think it deserves to do better than that (especially taking into account the caliber of many of the other images in the challenge)</td>', 'I think you might be wrong in this instance... reckon this will do better than 5.0000... but I have to say, I feel your pain.  But, lets talk about the photo.  A tad on the uninteresting side for my liking... there''s not enough here to keep me looking.  Don''t get me wrong, it''s a pretty scene, there''s just no real subject that grabs the viewer.  Colours are good, though I think I see a hint of pink in some of the clouds... I do like your tag line though, well and truly fitting for the challenge.  I hope that you get above 5.0000, I honestly think it deserves to do better than that (especially taking into account the caliber of many of the other images in the challenge)', '2009-05-13 04:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5483447, 789628, 28742, '<td valign="top">Good concept (albeit not original), good photo, bad fake blood and bad font choice.</td>', 'Good concept (albeit not original), good photo, bad fake blood and bad font choice.', '2009-05-13 04:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5483448, 790702, 28742, '<td valign="top">Exact same concept as one I previously voted on. I like this one better.</td>', 'Exact same concept as one I previously voted on. I like this one better.', '2009-05-13 04:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5483450, 790448, 32011, '<td valign="top">Ah... I take it you''re an engineer.  I used this very line yesterday.  :)<br/> <br/>Is there a slight tilt to this or is it just me?  I''m going to assume the latter.  This is one of the better "half full/half empty" submissions in the challenge.  I think it''s done well, but might have benefited from a less decorated glass, and if you''d waited until the bubbles in the OJ had gone... these details take away from the minimalism the rest of the image is conveying.  Should do okay...</td>', 'Ah... I take it you''re an engineer.  I used this very line yesterday.  :) Is there a slight tilt to this or is it just me?  I''m going to assume the latter.  This is one of the better "half full/half empty" submissions in the challenge.  I think it''s done well, but might have benefited from a less decorated glass, and if you''d waited until the bubbles in the OJ had gone... these details take away from the minimalism the rest of the image is conveying.  Should do okay...', '2009-05-13 04:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
