(5485246, 790702, 83313, '<td valign="top">I thought for sure this was a direct copy of something from despair.com, but I don''t see it there. Still sure this was "inspired" by another work. Good job on the lighting. I have difficulty photographing metal without glare from my lights. A nitpick is that I see some jaggies on the edges fork handles that may have been avoidable.</td>', 'I thought for sure this was a direct copy of something from despair.com, but I don''t see it there. Still sure this was "inspired" by another work. Good job on the lighting. I have difficulty photographing metal without glare from my lights. A nitpick is that I see some jaggies on the edges fork handles that may have been avoidable.', '2009-05-13 23:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
