(5488882, 790561, 83313, '<td valign="top">There''s a heck of a lot of JPEG compression artifacts showing in this, but your file size is reasonable. I am guessing you may have saved and reopened the JPG a few time while working on this. Always save your work in progress as a noncompressed format. PSD for photoshop, PSPIMAGE for PaintShop Pro, or a TIF also works. Save as JPG only when you make your final output.</td>', 'There''s a heck of a lot of JPEG compression artifacts showing in this, but your file size is reasonable. I am guessing you may have saved and reopened the JPG a few time while working on this. Always save your work in progress as a noncompressed format. PSD for photoshop, PSPIMAGE for PaintShop Pro, or a TIF also works. Save as JPG only when you make your final output.', '2009-05-16 00:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
