(5491043, 788911, 55005, '<td valign="top">The colors look quite washed out here and the poster has a fairly gloomy feel that does go well together with the message. I guess not everything about demotivational has to be bright and colorful. :)</td>', 'The colors look quite washed out here and the poster has a fairly gloomy feel that does go well together with the message. I guess not everything about demotivational has to be bright and colorful. :)', '2009-05-18 10:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
