(5496422, 790544, 61961, '<td valign="top">I laughed out loud at this, but couldn''t get past the fact there is no photo.  So sue me for wanting a photo in a photo challenge!  Taking into account the similar (though inferior) "procrastination" entries, I finally gave this a 4.<br/> <br/>PS: The larger font does look degraded, perhaps it''s supposed to look that way, but it seemed as if it was a result of resizing.</td>', 'I laughed out loud at this, but couldn''t get past the fact there is no photo.  So sue me for wanting a photo in a photo challenge!  Taking into account the similar (though inferior) "procrastination" entries, I finally gave this a 4. PS: The larger font does look degraded, perhaps it''s supposed to look that way, but it seemed as if it was a result of resizing.', '2009-05-22 12:36:34.000000', NULL, 0),
