(5497640, 790500, 67145, '<td valign="top">buggar ben ... i got a dq once after i''d asked not once but twice for advice on processing .. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=651068" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jilted</a> it was in the black and white in colour challenge ... i think in that situation bad communication was at fault, them assuming i knew stuff and me assuming that they knew stuff .. but neither of us did !!!<br/>i wrote to them telling them to undo the dq coz they had said my processing was ok .. lol ...<br/>anyway after heaps of emails back and forth i simmered down and accepted their ruling .. <br/>but it felt bad, especially at first, partly because i thought other ppl would think i tried to break the rules .. mine was getting a 6.5 at the time of the dq &amp; dont think i was heading for a ribbon or a HM like this one got .. <br/>i know my dq was different from yours, but hopefully the sc''ll see that the editing steps you sent in dont fit in with this image and revoke the dq .. then of course i''ll go to the second page again .. lol .. !!! ..:)</td>', 'buggar ben ... i got a dq once after i''d asked not once but twice for advice on processing .. jilted it was in the black and white in colour challenge ... i think in that situation bad communication was at fault, them assuming i knew stuff and me assuming that they knew stuff .. but neither of us did !!!i wrote to them telling them to undo the dq coz they had said my processing was ok .. lol ...anyway after heaps of emails back and forth i simmered down and accepted their ruling .. but it felt bad, especially at first, partly because i thought other ppl would think i tried to break the rules .. mine was getting a 6.5 at the time of the dq & dont think i was heading for a ribbon or a HM like this one got .. i know my dq was different from yours, but hopefully the sc''ll see that the editing steps you sent in dont fit in with this image and revoke the dq .. then of course i''ll go to the second page again .. lol .. !!! ..:)', '2009-05-23 18:25:33.000000', NULL, 0),
