(5498320, 790500, 54645, '<td valign="top">Steps submitted: crop, exposure, wb in LR2, export to CS4, photokit sharpening to snail with mask, two curves adjustmet, hue/sat adjustment to master, created border, added text, resized.<br/> <br/>When I created this poster I made an attempt to enter at the 200 file size limit, when it was rejected I realized it was a basic challenge. I remade the poster under the basic ruleset. Global USM produced the nearly the same results but with more artifact in the snail. <br/> <br/>Lesson for me: keep a copy with the layers or write down the steps. If I had that I would not have made that error.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Steps submitted: crop, exposure, wb in LR2, export to CS4, photokit sharpening to snail with mask, two curves adjustmet, hue/sat adjustment to master, created border, added text, resized. When I created this poster I made an attempt to enter at the 200 file size limit, when it was rejected I realized it was a basic challenge. I remade the poster under the basic ruleset. Global USM produced the nearly the same results but with more artifact in the snail.  Lesson for me: keep a copy with the layers or write down the steps. If I had that I would not have made that error. ', '2009-05-24 15:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
